# Zegel — the app.
#
# Every value below has a working keyless default. Copy this file to `.env.local`
# only if you want to change one; the app runs with none of them set, and the
# read paths work with no wallet and no account at all.

# --- Mobula ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unset means the demo host, https://demo-api.mobula.io — no key, no signup,
# ~40 endpoints. A key switches to https://api.mobula.io for higher rate limits.
# Nothing else changes, and the credit meter reports whichever host answered.
# MOBULA_API_KEY=

# --- RPC ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Prepended to the keyless fallbacks, not replacing them.
# ETH_RPC_URL=https://ethereum-rpc.publicnode.com
# BASE_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.base.org

# --- Swarm -------------------------------------------------------------------
# The publisher node. Holds the ACT private key, so only it can seal, grant,
# revoke or reseal. Without it, issuing and access control are refused — never
# faked — and the health strip says which capability went missing.
# ZEGEL_BEE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:1633

# A second Bee node standing in for a grantee. ACT decryption happens inside Bee
# with the reader's own key and there is no browser implementation, so showing a
# real granted read means a real second node. An unfunded ultra-light node is
# enough — reading costs nothing.
# ZEGEL_BEE_READER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:1643

# Postage batch to stamp uploads with. Unset means the seal layer finds a usable
# batch on the node, or buys one.
# ZEGEL_POSTAGE_BATCH_ID=

# ACT publisher key, when the backend cannot report its own. A wrong value here
# does not fail loudly: every read simply returns 404.
# ZEGEL_ACT_PUBLISHER=

# Only consulted when a node is unreachable, which the app treats as fatal for
# issuing rather than falling back to it.
# SWARM_GATEWAY_URL=https://api.gateway.ethswarm.org

# --- On chain ----------------------------------------------------------------
# ZegelAnchor, deployed to Base mainnet 2026-09-04. Permissionless, no owner.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ZEGEL_ANCHOR=0xbcB85eCdeF23a11D5015b260cC4eDCc0c250f42e

# The name the reference is published under, used to prefill the inspection desk.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ZEGEL_NAME=zegel.eth
